    "Removed self-navigation links from account-status and safety-appeal. Existing cross-links and system notices remain.",
    "Original account status punishments/selected detail arrays are unreachable in status load; actual current/history arrays retained. Appeal mode uses appeals/selectedPunishment/selectedAppeal; management-only arrays/history remain in original shared template.",
    "Progress refresh is now in loaded/else branches, with unchanged busy disable gate."
  ]
